    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "WUTjo",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "name": "Gate Note - Font Substitution",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 240,
      "content": "COLOR: exact. Every fill references a document variable whose hex is the committed app/globals.css token (background #000000, primary #dc2626, secondary #ffffff, muted #404040, muted-foreground #a1a1a1, destructive #ff6467, border #ffffff26). Single theme, no Light/Dark axis - same as the code.\n\nTYPE: APPROXIMATE. pen.dev only ships Google fonts, and neither shipping face is one. font-display uses UnifrakturMaguntia standing in for Kraut-type-a-fuck; font-body uses Cinzel standing in for Copperplate Gothic Std 30 AB. font-serif-mark uses Playfair Display standing in for the FLESH wordmark, which is a fixed logo asset and not a type-system role at all.\n\nSo these artboards are a binding reference for colour, layout, spacing and hierarchy - and NOT for letterforms. Approving this gate approves the composition, not the typeface rendering."
    },
